  "name": "policy_merge",
  "note": "Merge of the policy hierarchy (policy.schema.json): `levels` outermost first (org, workspace, vault, engine; at most one each), each document validated, then merged member by member by its x-merge rule. `effective` is authored by hand and never re-blessed; `effective_digest` = \"sha256:\" + hex(sha256(canonical_json(effective))) is derived. A case with `error` must be refused with that code at that member path (\"\" = the document or chain as a whole). Merging never weakens any member relative to any input, is idempotent, commutative and associative where defined. Case bundle_chain is the input of routes/policy_bundle.v2.response.json."
}
